3 STAE Gävleborgs län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://aforum.genealogi.se/discus/messages/576/202227.html?1450879494
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan worked as a inspector/controller at Sandö Factory (Nora) where they made glass. He lived in Abrå (X) between 1788-1790 where he worked as a inspector at Larsbo sawmill.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan married Eva Elisabeth Dillner in 1775.11.30 in Härnösand. According to the records it looks like they divorced somewhere between 1790 and 1794. This was not very common at that time.
2 CONT
2 CONT They got seven children of wich we know of:
2 CONT
2 CONT Eric Johan Backmark born 1779.05.11 in Viksjö
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars Sivert Backmark born 1777.02.26 in Viksjö dead 1830.02.23 (cause of death is directly translated "Nerve Fever") in Angarn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fredric Ulric Backmark born 1782 in Gudmundrå, dead 1788.04.25 in Enånger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva Christina Backmark born 1783 dead 1810.06.01 in Stockholm
2 CONT
2 CONT Erik Johan Backmark born 1785.12.25
2 CONT
2 CONT Vendela Ulrica Backmark born 1788.04.22 in Larbso, Arbrå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margareta Lovisa Backmark born 1790 in Larsbo, Abrrå dead 1865.11.04 in Örnsköldsvik.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0033846_00050
2 CONT
2 CONT Källhänvisning
2 CONT
2 CONT Viksjö kyrkoarkiv, Födelse- och dopböcker, SE/HLA/1010225/C/1 (1753 23/8-1800), bildid: C0033846_00050, sida 43
