2 CONT Maka: Kerstin Persdotter; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn: Brita Olofsdotter), Daniel Olofsson, Sigrid Olsdotter, Jonas Olsson, Kierstin Olsdotter, Karin Olsdotter;
