2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of  Peder Bengtsson Swedish (-1616) & Margareta Kagg resident: Sätra, Värmland, Died: 1626 
2 CONT * (No 258), dead 1626. Rittmeister in Säter, Eskilsäter FS (LH). The names of his sons and daughters along with the latter's poisons and descendants are collected in a succession investigation, made 1701, concerning the reduced Ös
2 CONC tbro in Bro FS (LH)
2 CONT * 2 weapons: Silfversvärd and Swedish.
2 CONT * Brother of Måns Svenske; Barbro Pedersdotter; Anna Persdotter Svenske and Johan Pedersson Svenske (Nr:258)  Occupation: Rider in Säter, Eskilsäter fs (Vä)., Rider, Owned Sitter in Eskilsäter, Captain, rider
2 CONT
