2 CONC etter writer register - The National Archives' individual archives and collections. Margareta Lennartsdotter Svenske, (nr 258) was the wife of Major Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud of Västergötland, Nr.199  Elin Jakobsdotter Baat daughter
2 CONC .  '''Kjell Magnell in his essay "Pelle i Ramstad, Stårckarna och Elin Jakobsdotter" (Släkt och Hävd 1965, pp 397-420). Stated that Elin Jacobsdotter wasn’t a Baat is totally incorrect! HERE’S THE PROOF! '''
