2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Elin-Jakobsdotter/4579386?through=6000000116723730935 '''Elin Jakobsdotter Bååt,''' Married to Ridder Lennart Pedersson Swedish (N: o 258), to Sätra]  27. Jakob Jakobsson Snakenborg Bååt children ado
2 CONC pted the name Bååt after the coat of arms. Margareta Persdotter, was Holmfrid Pehrsdotter Pik sister, who married to Nils Månsson Roos.  She was a Large landowner in Värmland and Dalsland. She inherited freehold property in Steneb
2 CONC y parish on Dal from her mother Karin Andersdotter. After the death of her father Per Larsson's "Little Per", she also inherited the Bro manor in Värmland, where she and her husband Nils Månsson Roos are said to have stayed from 1
2 CONC 579. After her husband's death in 1603, Margareta ruled and ruled over her domains alone. In Steneby alone under the Dingelvik estate, she had 12 rescue homes. It was not only in Steneby that she owned properties. According to a p
2 CONC rotocol from 1619, she owned the entire Sund farm in the parish of Nössemark in Dal, as well as a number of salvation homes in Värmland. Margareta Persdotter died childless in Bro around 1629 and [https://start.varmlandsrotter.se/
2 CONC varmlandsanor/artiklar/1999_1/ '''Elin Jacobsdotter Snakeborg Bååt, wife of master rider Lennart Persson Svenske, who was registered as the nearest heir.''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =(4th) Main Source=
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter Karin Lydersdotter Svenske married Lars Larssonthe elder, ennobled Silfverswärd, son of Lars Jonsson in her 1st marriage (married 2nd 1648 to Major Håkan Larsson, adlad Svärdsköld , in his 2nd marriage, died 1654), died 1
2 CONC 678-01-00 and lies with both her men and the stepson Olov buried in Kvänum according to the inscription on their epitaph, then, daughter of the rider champion Lennart (Linder) Pedersson Svenske and Elin Bååt .] [https://www.adelsv
