2 CONC arsdotter. Was owned by the well-to-do Mrs. Karin, who held both Dingelviks farms. Eästviken, Åsen, Högen, Hölgerud, Sea, Bågen and others. In 1577 Nils Månsson at Bro was here: 1664 Mrs. Margareta Swedish: 1783 Hofjunkare Reuter:
2 CONC  1809 Ryttmä-Staren Sam. Kafle: 1827 Carl Pet. Åberg: 1845 The Crown County Man in Näs hardened by Wermland J. E. Wennerlöf: 18-17 Baronen S: t Gyr and Countess Ramel, born eewenhaupt. source: Beskrifning öfver grefskapet Dal.]
