1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Olof migrated from Sweden to Australia in 1900. He lived in Brisbane, and had an oyster fishing business. He never married. He had air mail correspondence (in Swedish) with his sister Anna (Staffan's grandmother), 
2 CONC but gradually forgot how to speak Swedish. He went to the German church in Brisbane. Staffan saw his plaque at the cemetery in Brisbane in 1989.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Emigrerade från Hammerdal Jämtland till Australien 26 februari 1900.
