1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She often sang religious songs when I was little.She loked cats. She beleivd hat what was meant to happen will happen anyway, so she was not afraid of anything. Liked to travel fast in cars...
2 CONT
2 CONT She had a strong body, but was operated on at leasy 16 times. Dr Norman at Sodertalje hospital. When home from hospital, she would clean the walls or make cordial the next day, instead of resting for a week.
2 CONT
2 CONT She got aerograms from er brother Olof in Australia, in the early 1950s. She would read them out to me. Her brother wrote in Swedish, but said he couldnt speak Swedish any more, just read and write it.
